# item40m: Amos01 route. Player input plus named use/grab of map actors; no teleport,
# set_goal, take_control or weapon grant beyond the level's own pickups. Input is ignored
# while the authored cinematics own the controller (intro Cine0, Jones Cine3).
#
# The body up to the zone-19 crouch doorway is item40e/f/j (see
# local/reports/item40f-amos01-duct.md): the office's only exit is Porte17 (use), the chair
# ChaiseDeco2 swing breaks the zone-26 duct grille BreakAbleMover16, the west/north loop uses
# Porte24 and punches the cartons/vent grilles (BreakAbleMover44/56/9/8) with the Fists.
#
# item40m re-timed the post-duct tail to continuous movement, densely resampled along the
# known-good item40f waypoint polyline (every 80 UU) at a conservative ground speed (300 UU/s
# walking, 120 UU/s crouch-crawl) so the player is never stationary in the open and never
# arrives after a door use. Measured on the merged tree (local/re/item40m/amos01_diag1.log):
# with the item40j dash-and-wait cadence the player stood still ~90% of the run and the live
# AI bled 150 -> 0 by t=644 (BaseSoldier10 strip, BaseSoldier18/26 hall, BaseSoldier12 ring);
# the invulnerable run (amos01_inv.log) shows the potential damage is ~880 hp, dominated by
# BaseSoldier21 firing down the 32 corridor while the player waited at each 8-10 s waypoint.
# Every authored anchor keeps its position; every punch block and door use is kept.
# The Beretta+c9mmAmmo is the level's own pickup at (-2674,3679,75) (t=429 measured,
# BerettaPick1 Touch); no host grant. No teleports.
t=0.50 forward 1
t=1.50 forward 0
# Control returns after the intro (~t=84). Jones (Cine3) waits "wait player 192" behind the
# office vent grille: walk to him so his scene (jones03, exit through the vent duct) finishes.
t=86.00 goto 800 330
# Down the office stairs to the south door and open it.
t=100.00 goto 420 -470
t=104.00 goto 60 -300
t=108.00 goto 72 -470
t=110.00 yaw 270
t=110.50 use
# Corridor (zone 22) -> zone 25; grab the chair ChaiseDeco2 (Grab: bCanPickup branch).
t=114.00 goto 72 -700
t=118.00 goto 288 -1000
t=121.00 goto 156 -1053
t=122.50 track ChaiseDeco2
t=123.00 use ChaiseDeco2
t=123.10 track off
t=123.50 switch_weapon 20
# Break the duct grille BreakAbleMover16 with the chair swing.
t=125.00 goto 175 -1198
t=127.00 track BreakAbleMover16
t=128.00 shoot
t=129.50 track off
# Crouch and crawl the 128-UU duct (zone 26) west to its far grille BreakAbleMover17.
t=130.00 crouch on
t=130.50 goto 60 -1198
t=133.00 goto -300 -1198
t=137.00 goto -505 -1198
# item40f: crawl back out (BM17 is one-sided: item 1) and take the west/north ground route.
t=141.00 goto -300 -1198
t=145.00 goto 60 -1198
t=149.00 goto 175 -1198
t=152.00 crouch off
# Zone 25 -> corridor (zone 22) west, then north through the open 22-24 boundary (y=-544).
# item40f merge: since origin/main's item51b combat (GetFireStart/WeaponStartTrace + the
# rejection-sampled aim spread, "soldiers now hit the player on all five surveyed maps") the
# yard agent (IAController1, SeePlayer t=168.8) hits a standing player every ~2 s and the old
# dash-and-wait cadence (one goto every 6-8 s, standing at each waypoint) died at t~235
# (measured, health 150 -> 0 along the yard). The yard stretch is compressed so the player
# keeps moving (measured run speed ~400 UU/s); the punch and duct blocks keep their internal
# cadence, and every command after the duct entry keeps its original absolute time.
# item40j merge finish: the two remaining standing-under-fire stretches were re-timed the same
# way (BaseSoldier10's zone-19 strip, BaseSoldier18's hall) and the post-Porte7 tail is shifted
# 12.5 s earlier; see the measured notes at each stretch.
t=155.00 goto 288 -1000
t=161.00 goto 288 -900
t=168.00 goto -309 -789
t=170.00 goto -720 -833
t=172.00 goto -1000 -800
t=173.00 goto -1400 -780
t=175.00 goto -1800 -760
t=177.00 goto -2200 -730
t=178.50 goto -2430 -700
t=179.50 goto -2450 -580
t=180.50 goto -2460 -420
t=181.50 goto -2432 -310
t=183.00 use Porte24
# The 24-15 portal is at x -2560..-2432, y=-240: pass it west of the door leaf's swing.
t=184.00 goto -2490 -290
t=185.50 goto -2492 -160
# item40i: BaseSoldier1 (IAController4, Tag fbi1_pianote) is sent by TouchTrigger30 (t~179.9)
# into Patrouille at PatrolPoint3: LoopAnim 'Console', Sleep 1100, facing PatrolPoint3's yaw
# -36228 (161 deg, WNW). A fist hit calls MakeNoise(FireNoise 0.104) (XIIIWeapon.RealTraceFire
# 0x0412) and his Patrouille.HearNoise turns him (measured: the first carton punch put him in
# Acquisition at t=193.133, and he then shot the player through the duct crawl until death at
# t~246). Knock him out first, from behind: XIIIPawn.TakeDamage (0x0244) turns DTFisted into
# DTStunned when GetDamageSide >= 6 (hit behind, -0.7*CollisionRadius: +4; upper half,
# >= 0.5*CollisionHeight: +2) and the instigator carries StunningSkill. Stand ~60 UU behind
# him, aim along his facing at eye level (pitch 0) and punch.
t=186.00 switch_weapon 0
t=187.00 goto -2472 79
t=189.00 track BaseSoldier1
t=189.30 track off
t=189.30 pitch 0
t=190.50 shoot
t=191.50 goto -2320 40
# Punch the cartons (Fists, inventorygroup 0; Health 25 each). Their 'BreakCarton' event
# triggers XIIIDispatcher12 -> 'traitre2' -> Cine4 (the scripted arrival scene).
t=194.00 track BreakAbleMover44
t=196.00 shoot
t=197.50 shoot
t=199.00 shoot
t=200.50 shoot
t=202.00 goto -2320 120
t=206.00 track BreakAbleMover56
t=207.50 shoot
t=209.00 shoot
t=210.50 shoot
t=212.00 shoot
t=214.00 track off
# Duct 14 crawl (crouched, ceiling 128). The west grille BreakableMover9 (-2175,78) is wound
# unreal +X: it blocks eastward travel, so the punch must break it from zone 15 (measured in
# the probe: one fist hit at 100 damage units breaks Health 10; the fist RealTraceFire ray
# crosses the panel at unreal z=100).
t=217.00 crouch on
t=217.50 track BreakableMover9
t=218.50 shoot
t=220.00 track off
t=220.50 goto -2100 78
t=224.00 goto -1950 78
t=227.50 goto -1800 78
# The east grille BreakAbleMover8 (-1665,78) is a mover brush: two-sided, so it blocks the
# eastward crawl too and must be punched from inside the duct (Health 25, fist damage 10).
t=231.00 track BreakAbleMover8
t=232.00 shoot
t=233.50 shoot
t=235.00 shoot
t=236.50 shoot
t=238.00 track off
t=240.00 goto -1620 78
